# ML runtime state: durable routing traces and the active-model pointer.
# These are written by a running proxy and are data, not source. A relative
# `ml_routing.state_dir` resolves against the process working directory, which
# for a dev run is the crate root.
/ml/
**/ml/traces.jsonl
**/ml/active-model.json
**/ml/active-model-audit.jsonl
**/ml/*.json.tmp

